    "signature": "fn is_not_null(input: &dyn Array) -> Result<BooleanArray, arrow_schema::ArrowError>",
    "docs": "Returns a non-null [BooleanArray] with whether each value of the array is not null.\n# Error\nThis function never errors.\n# Example\n```rust\n# use arrow_array::BooleanArray;\n# use arrow_arith::boolean::is_not_null;\nlet a = BooleanArray::from(vec![Some(false), Some(true), None]);\nlet a_is_not_null = is_not_null(&a).unwrap();\nassert_eq!(a_is_not_null, BooleanArray::from(vec![true, true, false]));\n```",
